# Chain stage 6: codify the restock implementation end to end.
id: chain-codify
skill: highway-codify
fixture: implementation
chain: 6
open: /highway-codify
ask: Which implementation should this automation serve?
say: [select] The restock alerts implementation.
ask: Would you like to explore any of these options?
say: [select] 1
ask: What would you add, correct, or remove?
say: [accept] Looks good.
ask: Would you like to:
say: [select] 2
ask: Where would you like to go next?
say: [decline] Nothing else for now.
writes: code/**
expect: template code/code.md :: codify-catalog.md
expect: template code/*/.highway/features/001-*/codify.md :: codify-record.md
expect: template code/*/.highway/features/001-*/codify-tasks.md :: codify-tasks.md
expect: heading code/*/README.md :: ## Setup Instructions
reaches: choose
reaches: close
